# API secrets (Hugging Face)

- **Never** put `hf_` tokens in Dart files, comments, README, or git commits. GitHub will reject the push (GH013).
- Token lives only in **`env.json`** (gitignored). Template: `env.json.example`.
- App reads token via `String.fromEnvironment('HF_API_TOKEN')` and `--dart-define-from-file=env.json`.
- When editing `lib/api_config.dart`, do not add default token values or example tokens that look real.
- If the user needs a token in the project, tell them to run `scripts/setup.ps1` once and edit `env.json` locally.
